{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>By the spring of water</b> Two times in the Masorah: this one and the other: \"here I stand by the spring of water.\" That it is good to pray by water, as written: \"from the noise of archers among the water-drawers, there shall they recount the righteous deeds of YHWH,\" and so prayer is likened to water, as written: \"pour out your heart like water.\""], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:12.533649342Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}